    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "OMD Estate Agents are delighted to bring to the market this beautifully presented end-of-terrace property located in the ever-popular Rosemount Estate, Dublin 14.\r\nBuilt in 2004, this charming home offers well-proportioned and bright accommodation throughout, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, young families, or investors alike.The property comprises two spacious double bedrooms and a well-finished attic conversion, providing excellent additional space suitable for a home office, guest room, or storage. There is a downstairs WC, along with a main family bathroom on the first floor.\r\nThe home benefits from double-glazed PVC windows throughout, ensuring comfort and energy efficiency. Presented in turn-key condition, the property is ready for immediate occupation.\r\nExternally, the property enjoys a south-facing front garden, creating a peaceful and sunny outdoor space ideal for relaxing evenings, enhanced by mature hawthorn and apple trees. The house itself is filled with natural light and offers a warm, inviting atmosphere.\r\nRosemount Estate is a highly sought-after residential development in Dublin 14, ideally positioned close to a range of excellent amenities.\r\nThe property is within walking distance of several well-regarded schools, including Our Lady’s National School (Ballinteer), Holy Cross Primary School, Dundrum, and Ballinteer Educate Together National School. For secondary education, the area is served by Ballinteer Community School, St Tiernan’s Community School, and Rosemont School.\r\nThere is also excellent access to third-level institutions including University College Dublin (UCD) and other colleges within easy reach of Dublin City.\r\nPublic transport is very well serviced, with multiple bus routes nearby providing easy access to Dublin City Centre, while the Luas Green Line at Dundrum and Balally is only a short distance away, offering convenient commuter links.\r\nLocal shopping centres such as Dundrum Town Centre, as well as parks, cafes, and recreational facilities, are all within close proximity, making this an exceptionally convenient and family-friendly location.\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Double Glazed \r\nEnd-of-terrace property in mature residential estate\r\nAttic conversion providing additional flexible space\r\nDownstairs WC and main family bathroom\r\nDouble-glazed PVC windows throughout\r\nTurn-key condition throughout\r\nSouth-facing front garden with mature planting\r\nExcellent natural light throughout the property\r\nStrong transport links including Luas Green Line and Dublin Bus routes\r\nBuilt in 2004"
      },
